8	 * where {@code customerCode} is the owner's previously assigned region-and-hash customer code and
9	 * {@code YY} is the last two digits of the owner's fiscal year — the financial year (starting
10	 * 1 July) of the business-day-adjusted registration date, named by its ending calendar year (e.g.
11	 * an October 2026 registration falls in fiscal year 2027, giving {@code NSW-1A2B3C4D-M27}).
